{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../UpgradedGift/", "title": "UpgradedGift"}, "next": {"link": "../MessageAutoDeleteTimerChanged/", "title": "MessageAutoDeleteTimerChanged"}, "title": "WebAppData", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"webappdata\">\n<h1>WebAppData<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#webappdata\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.WebAppData\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">WebAppData</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.WebAppData\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Contains data sent from a <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/webapps\">Web App</a> to the bot.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>data</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 The data. Be aware that a bad client can send arbitrary data in this field.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>button_text</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Text of the <em>web_app</em> keyboard button from which the Web App was opened. Be aware that a bad client can send arbitrary data in this field.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/MessageAutoDeleteTimerChanged", "MessageAutoDeleteTimerChanged", "N", 